{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Etymology===
{{LL.}} {{term|bronchus|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc}} {{term|βρόγχος|sc=Grek|tr=bronchos||windpipe}} + {{term|-itis|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es|-}}

# {{uncountable}} An [[inflammation]] of the [[bronchus|bronchi]] of the [[lung]]s, that causes the [[cilia]] of the bronchial epithelial cells to stop functioning.  
# {{countable}} An occurrence of, a case (patient) of, or a type of bronchitis.

